  "notes": [
    "capex is NOT a separately disclosed line item on screener.in's standard tables. Proxy fields provided: (a) 'cash_flow.cfi_cr' (cash used in investing activities, includes capex + investments in securities, not capex-only), (b) year-over-year change in 'balance_sheet.fixed_assets_cr' + 'balance_sheet.cwip_cr' (gross capex proxy, net of depreciation effects on WDV -- imperfect but directionally useful), (c) free_cash_flow_cr = CFO - capex is disclosed directly by screener, so capex can be back-solved as CFO - FCF where both are given.",
